WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.500
Ribby was reading to Jeremy.

2
00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:06.049
He liked the story.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.170
But it was hard to hear.

4
00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:13.225
His ears felt plugged up.

5
00:00:13.226 --> 00:00:25.647
Jemima was still making soup.

6
00:00:25.648 --> 00:00:27.870
She brought a pepper to Jeremy.

7
00:00:27.871 --> 00:00:29.866
"Eat this," she said.

8
00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:38.341
"Hot peppers are good for colds."

9
00:00:38.342 --> 00:00:41.918
Jeremy bit the hot pepper.

10
00:00:41.919 --> 00:00:46.652
It burned his mouth.

11
00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:52.120
"Water!" he gasped.

12
00:00:52.121 --> 00:00:55.546
"You don't need water," Mrs. Rabbit said.

13
00:00:55.547 --> 00:00:58.280
"Your house has too much water!"

14
00:00:58.281 --> 00:01:03.502
She mopped up another puddle.

15
00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:06.225
Jemima came over again.

16
00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:09.329
"Now try some garlic," she said.

17
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:21.541
She tried to feed some to Jeremy.

18
00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:24.385
"Stop!" Jeremy cried.

19
00:01:24.386 --> 00:01:27.067
Ribby gasped.

20
00:01:27.068 --> 00:01:29.555
His three friends stared at him.

21
00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:36.483
Jeremy coughed.

22
00:01:36.484 --> 00:01:42.866
He blew his nose.

23
00:01:42.867 --> 00:01:46.378
"I am very tired," he said.

24
00:01:46.379 --> 00:01:49.780
"I am going back to bed now."

25
00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:53.641
"Sleep is good for a cold," Ribby said.

26
00:01:53.642 --> 00:01:55.314
Jemima nodded.

27
00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:58.227
"You can eat the soup when you wake up."

28
00:01:58.228 --> 00:02:01.651
"We will all come back tomorrow," Jemima said.

29
00:02:01.652 --> 00:02:04.963
"That's okay," Jeremy said quickly.

30
00:02:04.964 --> 00:02:09.094
"I will still be asleep!"

